      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {[
          {
            tag: "💸 Cost Problem",
            title: "$500–$1,200 per creator video is broken",
            body: "Professional US, UK, and Australian UGC creators now charge $500–$1,200 per video, plus an extra 25%–100% just to run their face in paid ads. With DermaArc, your 1st video is free and every video after is just $99 flat.",
